ans-SG" label="中文（新加坡）‪（zh-sg）‬" data-dir="ltr" /><track src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/api.php?action=timedtext&amp;title=File%3ANational_Flag_Anthem_of_the_Republic_of_China%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E6%B0%91%E5%9C%8B%E5%9C%8B%E6%97%97%E6%AD%8C_%28%E6%BC%94%E5%A5%8F%E7%89%88%29.oga&amp;lang=zh-tw&amp;trackformat=vtt&amp;origin=%2A" kind="subtitles" type="text/vtt" srclang="zh-Hant-TW" label="中文（臺灣）‪（zh-tw）‬" data-dir="ltr" /><track src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/api.php?action=timedtext&amp;title=File%3ANational_Flag_Anthem_of_the_Republic_of_China%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E6%B0%91%E5%9C%8B%E5%9C%8B%E6%97%97%E6%AD%8C_%28%E6%BC%94%E5%A5%8F%E7%89%88%29.oga&amp;lang=zh&amp;trackformat=vtt&amp;origin=%2A" kind="subtitles" type="text/vtt" srclang="zh" label="中文‪（zh）‬" data-dir="ltr" /></audio></span></span></center></div></center></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-full-data" style=""><div role="img" class="floatright nounderlines noresize" style="width: 316px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; line-height: 1; text-align: center; background-color: var(--background-color-base,#ffffff); color:inherit; position: relative;"><figure class="mw-halign-none" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/File:Subdivision_types_of_the_Republic_of_China_(2014).svg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Subdivision_types_of_the_Republic_of_China_%282014%29.svg/330px-Subdivision_types_of_the_Republic_of_China_%282014%29.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="424" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Subdivision_types_of_the_Republic_of_China_%282014%29.svg/960px-Subdivision_types_of_the_Republic_of_China_%282014%29.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="850" data-file-height="1200" /></a><figcaption>臺灣本島劃分為一個省（即臺灣省）、六個直轄市（臺北市、新北市、桃園市、臺中市、臺南市、高雄市），其中臺灣省劃分為十一個縣（含澎湖群島澎湖縣）、三個市（基隆市、新竹市、嘉義市）。</figcaption></figure>
