<li id="cite&#95;note-何義麟-15"><span class="mw-cite-backlink">^ <a href="#cite_ref-何義麟_15-0"><sup><b>12.0</b></sup></a> <a href="#cite_ref-何義麟_15-1"><sup><b>12.1</b></sup></a></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite id="CITEREF何義麟2002" class="citation report">何義麟. <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20161016025143/https://www.koryu.or.jp/08_03_03_01_middle.nsf/1384a27fc6686a1a49256798000a62f6/9c5e151017fdbbd549256b19000ee01c/$FILE/hoilin2.pdf">戰後台灣人之國籍變更與國家認同──以澀谷事件之考察為中心</a> <span style="font-size:85%;">(PDF)</span> (報告). <a href="/wiki/%E8%87%BA%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82" title="臺北市">臺北市</a>: <a href="/wiki/%E8%B2%A1%E5%9C%98%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%A4%E6%B5%81%E5%8D%94%E6%9C%83" class="mw-redirect" title="財團法人交流協會">財團法人交流協會</a>: 第6, 11頁. 2002年2月 <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2016-05-12</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.koryu.or.jp/08_03_03_01_middle.nsf/1384a27fc6686a1a49256798000a62f6/9c5e151017fdbbd549256b19000ee01c/$FILE/hoilin2.pdf">原始內容</a> <span style="font-size:85%;">(PDF)</span>存檔於2016-10-16）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%87%BA%E7%81%A3%E6%88%B0%E5%BE%8C%E6%99%82%E6%9C%9F&amp;rft.au=%E4%BD%95%E7%BE%A9%E9%BA%9F&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%88%B0%E5%BE%8C%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%BA%BA%E4%B9%8B%E5%9C%8B%E7%B1%8D%E8%AE%8A%E6%9B%B4%E8%88%87%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%B6%E8%AA%8D%E5%90%8C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E4%BB%A5%E6%BE%80%E8%B0%B7%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E4%B9%8B%E8%80%83%E5%AF%9F%E7%82%BA%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83&amp;rft.date=2002-02&amp;rft.genre=report&amp;rft.pages=%E7%AC%AC6%2C+11%E9%A0%81&amp;rft.place=%E8%87%BA%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82&amp;rft.pub=%E8%B2%A1%E5%9C%98%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%A4%E6%B5%81%E5%8D%94%E6%9C%83&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.koryu.or.jp%2F08&#95;03&#95;03&#95;01&#95;middle.nsf%2F1384a27fc6686a1a49256798000a62f6%2F9c5e1