<li id="cite&#95;note-52"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-52">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite id="CITEREFMonte&#95;R.&#95;Bullard2008" class="citation book">Monte R. Bullard. <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160413051403/http://mercury.ethz.ch/serviceengine/Files/ISN/145370/ipublicationdocument_singledocument/e7a70ac7-41c6-4367-9382-7cfd1fd3affb/en/Strait+Talk+-+Avoiding+a+Nuclear+War+Between+the+US+and+China+over+Taiwan.pdf">Strait Talk: Avoiding a Nuclear War Between the US and China over Taiwan</a> <span style="font-size:85%;">(PDF)</span>. <a href="/wiki/%E8%92%99%E7%89%B9%E9%9B%B7_(%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%A9%E7%A6%8F%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A%E5%B7%9E)" title="蒙特雷 (加利福尼亞州)">Monterey, CA</a>: <a href="/wiki/%E8%A9%B9%E5%A7%86%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E9%A6%AC%E4%B8%81%E9%98%B2%E6%93%B4%E6%95%A3%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83" class="mw-redirect" title="詹姆斯·馬丁防擴散研究中心">James Martin Center for Nonproliferation Studies (CNS)</a>. 2008: p. 294. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://mercury.ethz.ch/serviceengine/Files/ISN/145370/ipublicationdocument_singledocument/e7a70ac7-41c6-4367-9382-7cfd1fd3affb/en/Strait+Talk+-+Avoiding+a+Nuclear+War+Between+the+US+and+China+over+Taiwan.pdf">原始內容</a> <span style="font-size:85%;">(PDF)</span>存檔於2016-04-13） <span style="font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;" title="連接到英語網頁">（英語）</span>.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%87%BA%E7%81%A3%E6%88%B0%E5%BE%8C%E6%99%82%E6%9C%9F&amp;rft.au=Monte+R.+Bullard&amp;rft.btitle=Strait+Talk%3A+Avoiding+a+Nuclear+War+Between+the+US+and+China+over+Taiwan&amp;rft.date=2008&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.pages=p.+294&amp;rft.place=Monterey%2C+CA&amp;rft.pub=James+Martin+Center+for+Nonproliferation+Studies+%28CNS%29&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fmercury.ethz.ch%2Fserviceengine%2FFiles%2FISN%2F145370%2Fipublicationdocument&#95;singledocument%2Fe7a70ac7-41c6-4367-9382-7cfd1fd3affb%2Fen%2FStrait%2BTalk%2B-%2BAvoiding%2Ba%2BNuclear%2BWar%2BBetween%2Bthe%2BUS%2Band%2BChina%2Bover%2BTaiwan.pdf&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span><span class="citation-comment" style="display:none; color:#33aa33"> 引文格式1維護：冗餘文本 (<a href="/wiki/Category:%E5%BC%95%E6%96%87%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F1%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%97%E4%BD%99%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC" title="Category:引文格式1維護：冗餘文本">link</a>)</span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-53"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-53">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><span title="日語文本"><span lang="ja"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/SENTAKU/sangiin/038/0514/03803150514015.pdf">参議院会議録情報 第038回国会 予算委員会 第15号</a>. 昭和36年3月15日. p. 19.</span></span> <span style="font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;" title="日語">（日語）</span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-55"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-55">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite id="CITEREFDepartment&#95;of&#95;State1950" class="citation book"><a href="/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%9C%8B%E5%8B%99%E9%99%A2" class="mw-redirect" title="美國國務院">Department of State</a>. Department of State Bulletin <b>22</b>. <a href="/wiki/%E8%8F%AF%E7%9B%9B%E9%A0%93%E5%93%A5%E5%80%AB%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9E%E7%89%B9%E5%8D%80" class="mw-redirect" title="華盛頓哥倫比亞特區">Washington, D.C.</a>: <span class="ilh-all" data-orig-title="美國政府印務局" data-lang-code="en" data-lang-name="英语" data-foreign-title="United States Government Printing Office"><span class="ilh-page"><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%8D%B0%E5%8B%99%E5%B1%80&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="美國政府印務局（頁面不存在）">美國政府印務局</a></span><span class="noprint ilh-comment"><span class="ilh-paren">（</span><span class="ilh-lang">英語</span><span class="ilh-colon">：</span><span class="ilh-link"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Government_Printing_Office" class="extiw" title="en:United States Government Printing Office"><span lang="en" dir="auto">United States Government Printing Office</span></a></span><span class="ilh-paren">）</span></span></span>. 1950: <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://archive.org/stream/departmentofstat2250unit#page/80/mode/2up">80</a> <span style="font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;" title="連接到英語網頁">（英語）</span>. <q>The Chinese have administered Formosa for 4 years. Neither the United States nor any other ally ever questioned that authority and that occupation. When Formosa was made a province of China nobody raised any lawyers' doubts about that. That was regarded as in accordance with the commitments. Now, in the opinion of some, the situation is changed. They believe that the forces now in control of the mainland of China, the forces which undoubtedly will soon be recognized by some other countries, are not friendly to us, and therefore they want to say, “Well, we have to wait for a treaty.”</q></cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%87%BA%E7%81%A3%E6%88%B0%E5%BE%8C%E6%99%82%E6%9C%9F&amp;rft.au=Department+of+State&amp;rft.btitle=Department+of+State+Bulletin&amp;rft.date=1950&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.pages=80&amp;rft.place=Washington%2C+D.C.&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-all+%22+data-orig-title%3D%22%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%8D%B0%E5%8B%99%E5%B1%80%22+data-lang-code%3D%22en%22+data-lang-name%3D%22%E8%8B%B1%E8%AF%AD%22+data-foreign-title%3D%22United+States+Government+Printing+Office%22%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-page%22%3E%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%8D%B0%E5%8B%99%E5%B1%80%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22noprint+ilh-comment%22%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-paren%22%3E%EF%BC%88%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-lang%22%3E%E8%8B%B1%E8%AF%AD%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-colon%22%3E%EF%BC%9A%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-link%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22en%22+dir%3D%22auto%22%3E-%7BUnited+States+Government+Printing+Office%7D-%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan+class%3D%22ilh-paren%22%3E%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-56"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-56">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite id="CITEREF1951" class="citation news"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="http://query.nytimes.com/gst/abstract.html?res=9805E2D7143BE13BBC4D53DFB366838A649EDE" href="https://query.nytimes.com/gst/abstract.html?res=9805E2D7143BE13BBC4D53DFB366838A649EDE">Transcript of Second Day of MacArthur's Testimony</a><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="需要付費訂閱"><img alt="需要付費訂閱" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Lock-red-alt.svg/20px-Lock-red-alt.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="9" height="14" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="813" /></span></span>. <a href="/wiki/%E7%B4%90%E7%B4%84%E6%99%82%E5%A0%B1" class="mw-redirect" title="紐約時報">New York Times</a> (<a href="/wiki/%E7%B4%90%E7%B4%84" class="mw-redirect" title="紐約">New York</a>). May 5, 1951: p. 4 <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">January 28,</span> 2015&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20150308073135/http://query.nytimes.com/gst/abstract.html?res=9805E2D7143BE13BBC4D53DFB366838A649EDE">存檔</a>於2015年3月8日） <span style="font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;" title="連接到英語網頁">（英語）</span>. <q>The Allies turned over what you might call the administration and the trusteeship of Formosa to China, just as Japan was turned over to us, and it is still in that status.</q></cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%87%BA%E7%81%A3%E6%88%B0%E5%BE%8C%E6%99%82%E6%9C%9F&amp;rft.atitle=Transcript+of+Second+Day+of+MacArthur%27s+Testimony&amp;rft.date=1951-05-05&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=New+York+Times&amp;rft.pages=p.+4&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fquery.nytimes.com%2Fgst%2Fabstract.html%3Fres%3D9805E2D7143BE13BBC4D53DFB366838A649EDE&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span><span class="citation-comment" style="display:none; color:#33aa33"> 引文格式1維護：冗餘文本 (<a href="/wiki/Category:%E5%BC%95%E6%96%87%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F1%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%97%E4%BD%99%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC" title="Category:引文格式1維護：冗餘文本">link</a>) 含有連結內容需訂閱查看的頁面 (<a href="/wiki/Category:%E5%90%AB%E6%9C%89%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%85%A7%E5%AE%B9%E9%9C%80%E8%A8%82%E9%96%B1%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%A0%81%E9%9D%A2" title="Category:含有連結內容需訂閱查看的頁面">link</a>)</span></span>
</li>
